# The authorization server's issuer, exactly as its discovery document names
# it. For Udibo, the tenant's issuer, such as https://<tenant id>.udibo.com.
# For Auth0, https://<your tenant's domain>/ (with the trailing slash).
OAUTH_ISSUER={yourIssuer}
OAUTH_CLIENT_ID={yourClientId}
# OAUTH_AUDIENCE={yourApiIdentifier}

# APP_BASE_URL=https://your-app.com
# API_BASE_URL=https://your-api-server.com
